node_modules/
*.cell
*.celz
*.cdkey
*.cdpub

# Demonstration cells cited as figure source data in docs/DEFENSIVE-DISCLOSURE.md
# are deliberately tracked: the figures quote their exact hashes, so a reader
# must be able to fetch the same bytes and recheck them. Purpose-built for
# publication — fixed content, keys generated at mint time, nothing personal.
# Regenerate with: node tools/make-figure-cells.mjs
!docs/figure-data/*.cell
